title: "Silent Defaults and Phantom Effects: attribution code and public-data benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Code for owner-aware differential-fallback repair in counterfactual attribution of
  expected-loss changes, with a public-data study built from SBA 7(a) FOIA files and the
  U.S. Census Bureau NAICS 2022-to-2017 concordance.
